# search.targets  -- file-authoritative search queries (Option A)
# Each non-comment line is ONE full search query string (DuckDuckGo via ddgs).
# Format:  query text | label | priority     (label+priority optional)
# Blank lines and # comments ignored. Prefix a line with ! to disable it.
# Edit this file then `docker restart unifiedcollector_collector` to apply.
#
# The old single "test query" placeholder is removed. Add your real queries
# below -- e.g. brand monitoring, topic tracking, your own name, etc.
# Examples (disabled -- enable by removing the leading !):

!Bryan Seah photographer Singapore | self-monitor | 5
!shotsbyseah | brand | 5
!"The Prawn Organisation" | brand | 5
